00:49:57,606 --> 00:50:00,606
それぞれの光が響き合い、世界をかたちづくる
Their respective lights resonate, shaping the world

752
00:50:00,906 --> 00:50:04,106
ReGLOSSはその瞬間を音楽とダンスで伝える
ReGLOSS conveys that moment through music and dance

753
00:50:10,479 --> 00:50:12,199
みんな見た見た見た？
Did you guys see that?!

754
00:50:12,569 --> 00:50:16,119
ということでね、みんな見た？見た？見た？
That's right, everyone, did you see it? Did you see it?

755
00:50:16,209 --> 00:50:19,739
やばい！12月16日、有明アリーナにて
No way! On December 16th, at Ariake Arena,

756
00:50:19,739 --> 00:50:23,949
