an arena live, seriously?! Seriously?! Such an incredible place!

757
00:50:24,559 --> 00:50:32,269
12月16日有明アリーナにて、ReGLOSSファーストライブ、「Flash point」の開催が決定しました！
On December 16th at Ariake Arena, the 1st ReGLOSS Live, "Flash point," has been officially announced!

758
00:50:33,439 --> 00:50:35,879
イエーイ！
Yay!

759
00:50:44,359 --> 00:50:46,259
え、現地ライブってことだよね？
Wait, does this mean an in-person live?

760
00:50:46,259 --> 00:50:46,959
そうだよ！
That's right!

761
00:50:46,959 --> 00:50:49,209
しかもめちゃくちゃでかい会場だよ！
Plus, it's a huge venue!

762
00:50:49,259 --> 00:50:51,259
そうだよ、そうだよ、そうだよね！
That's right, that's right, isn't it?!

763
00:50:51,259 --> 00:50:55,959
大変だ！夢が叶うってこと？そうだよね！
This is huge! Does this mean our dream is coming true? That's right!

764
00:50:56,459 --> 00:50:59,369
みんなありがとう！ありがとう！
Thank you everyone! Thank you!

765
00:50:59,579 --> 00:51:02,269
本当、すべてみんなのおかげだね、ありがとう！
It's truly thanks to all of you, thank you!

766
00:51:03,479 --> 00:51:06,269
1個目の夢が叶うかもしれないんだ！
Our first dream might actually come true!

767
00:51:06,589 --> 00:51:09,559
がんばろう！がんばろう！
Let's do our best! Let's do our best!

768
00:51:09,969 --> 00:51:13,759
はい！こちらのライブなんですけれども、セカンドアルバムで描いた世界観に連動して
Yes! For this live, linking with the worldview depicted in our second album,

769
00:51:13,759 --> 00:51:19,459
ReGLOSSの「今」を記憶に焼き付けるというテーマになっています。
the theme is to sear ReGLOSS's "now" into your memories.

770
00:51:19,879 --> 00:51:25,459
つまり、まさに今の私たちの集大成となるライブでございます！
In other words, this will truly be a live that is the culmination of who we are right now!

771
00:51:25,459 --> 00:51:26,759
イエーイ！
Yay!

772
00:51:27,409 --> 00:51:31,879
