硝子の淵で回り回るがが
Spinning round and round at the edge of the glass,

914
01:01:20,662 --> 01:01:21,472
耀く瑠璃色のビー玉
Shiny lapis lazuli-colored marble.

915
01:01:22,492 --> 01:01:23,012
なんだかその笑顔と紙一重だね
Somehow, it's a fine line from your smile.

916
01:01:24,192 --> 01:01:26,052
フィルムを覗けばノンフィクション
If you look through the film, it's non-fiction,

917
01:01:27,322 --> 01:01:28,132
彩りに絆されたメモリー
Memories bound by colors.

918
01:01:29,952 --> 01:01:30,932
リセットなんてできないから
Because I can't reset it,

919
