これがきっと愛だ
This must be love,

925
01:01:41,742 --> 01:01:42,382
二度と忘れないように
So I'll never forget it.

926
01:01:43,752 --> 01:01:44,172
le lemon lime orange

927
01:01:45,832 --> 01:01:46,612
キミと一生分の思い出
Memories for a lifetime with you,

928
01:01:48,962 --> 01:01:49,912
何気ない一日が one of a kind
A casual day is one of a kind.

929
01:01:52,412 --> 01:01:52,932
love yourself just as you are now

930
01:01:55,252 --> 01:01:55,592
氷が溶けては渦巻いた
Ice melting and swirling,

931
01:01:56,782 --> 01:01:57,282
魔法の杖代わりのマドラー
A muddler acting as a magic wand.

932
01:01:59,232 --> 01:01:59,862
喉の奥くすぐる炭酸
Carbonation tickling the back of the throat,

933
01:02:01,762 --> 01:02:02,252
薫る柑橘系のフレーバー
Fragrant citrus flavor.

934
01:02:03,412 --> 01:02:03,972
爽やかな気流にのって
Riding on the refreshing airflow,

935
01:02:05,672 --> 01:02:06,332
波の還りを見守っている beachside
Watching the waves return to the beachside.

936
01:02:07,952 --> 01:02:08,712
あどけない面影に焦がれ
Longing for the innocent appearance,

937
01:02:10,692 --> 01:02:11,192
微かに触れそうな指先
Fingertips that seem to touch faintly,

938
01:02:13,032 --> 01:02:13,592
煌めきで上書きしてしまおう
Let's paint over it with brilliance.

939
01:02:15,552 --> 01:02:16,212
get ahead of what you used to be

940
01:02:18,212 --> 01:02:18,472
踊ってミッドサマー
Dance to midsummer,

941
01:02:19,232 --> 01:02:19,892
アルゴリズムの中
In the algorithm,

942
