瞬息でダビングして
Dubbing in an instant,

943
01:02:22,632 --> 01:02:24,142
切り取って喜怒哀楽
Cut out the joys and sorrows.

944
01:02:25,092 --> 01:02:25,942
これがきっと愛だ
This must be love,

945
01:02:27,082 --> 01:02:27,822
二度と忘れないように
So I'll never forget it.

946
01:02:29,112 --> 01:02:29,742
ミッドサマーシトラス oh yeah
Midsummer Citrus, oh yeah,

947
01:02:31,192 --> 01:02:31,912
いつだって we got love!! okay
Always we got love!! okay.

948
